# UI/UX Standards

The application should feel like one polished professional SaaS product.

Maintain:

- Consistent typography
- Consistent spacing
- Design tokens
- Predictable form layouts
- Clear hierarchy
- Accessible contrast
- Keyboard accessibility
- Responsive behavior
- Consistent status badges
- Consistent feedback patterns

Use mature reusable primitives for:

- Buttons
- Inputs
- Selects
- Dialogs
- Tables
- Pagination
- Date/time controls
- Badges
- Snackbars
- Skeletons
- Empty states

Avoid:

- Excessive gradients
- Decorative animations
- Overloaded dashboards
- Unnecessary modals
- Inconsistent component styling

Before creating a new UI pattern, search for an existing project pattern and reuse it.
